<p>Spanish police said they found the body of James &quot;Jimmy&quot; Gracey, a 20-year-old American college student, in the water off a Barcelona beach on Thursday, after he went missing during a spring-break trip. Gracey studied at the University of Alabama, and several reports also said he was from Illinois. Reports said Gracey had been at a beachfront nightclub and became separated from friends around 3 a.m. before he disappeared. Police divers later recovered his body, and authorities positively identified him, bringing the search to an end.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/_c6Pxuo9wxsZYP4Dnc0yBKxX-6mqw8b9y8_lw4-hCK2pBJw--ZsruBaqYHln4r4v1iAJ_HJawGR4o_jh7AT57LdObyV0gscZhIwiESf9A2ZvOYj6Pf1Jxz0Y_AiP2tOc66_gd6dvpz2hogZhC6oD0esccVRCusjd8j_JJ6GwMZsDNqRHRD3YPwViBD4ls3JQT5OJGyhskEL_bVJEXikFaB45N-k' alt='Scene in Barcelona during the search for missing American student James Gracey.' /><br /><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/world/europe/american-student-missing-spain-barcelona-james-gracey.html'>Body of Missing University of Alabama Student Is Found Dead in Spain, Police Say</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/19/illinois-student-dead-barcelona'>Body of missing Illinois student found in waters off beach of Barcelona</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/news/world-news/2026/03/19/the-body-of-an-american-student-who-went-missing-in-barcelona-has-been-found-police-in-spain-say/'>The body of an American student who went missing in Barcelona has been found, police in Spain say</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/missing-u-s-students-body-has-been-found-in-barcelona-local-authorities-say'>Missing U.S. student&#x27;s body has been found in Barcelona, local authorities say</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/video/missing-american-college-student-found-dead-in-barcelona/'>Missing American college student found dead in B